  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{投|な}げる (to throw) + {込|こ}む (into) → to throw into\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb - takes を for the thrown object and に for the destination.\n\nPATTERN:\nXをYに{投|な}げ{込|こ}む = throw X into Y\n\nRELATED ～{込|こ}む COMPOUND VERBS:\n- {飛|と}び{込|こ}む (to jump into)\n- {迷|まよ}い{込|こ}む (to wander into)\n- {駆|か}け{込|こ}む (to rush into)\n- {入|はい}り{込|こ}む (to enter)",
